# Rise of the Varmints, Plot {2}{G}: Bot1 kills its own Memnite and Ornithopter on turn 1 (Lightning Bolt, Fatal Push), so its graveyard has two creature
# cards and two noncreature cards (the Bolt and the Push); Bot2 kills its own Memnite on turn 2, a creature card in an opponent's graveyard, not
# counted. It plots Rise on turn 3 and casts it free on turn 5: two 2/1 green Varmint tokens (not four, not three).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Fatal Push
Rise of the Varmints
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
